  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有個關於南瓜精的新真相被揭開，\n南瓜精圈子現在是熱鬧哄哄的呢………<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6709500B95DC65BC535774DC7CBE768465B0771F76F888AB63ED958BFF0C000A535774DC7CBE57085B5073FE5728662F71B19B2754C454C47684546220262026202600100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新真相？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65B0771F76F8FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "熱鬧哄哄？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71B19B2754C454C4FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "南瓜精可依據大小分類為\n小尺寸、普通尺寸、<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大尺寸，以及特大尺寸。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n過去都是這樣分類的，但……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "535774DC7CBE53EF4F9D64DA59275C0F5206985E70BA000A5C0F5C3A5BF83001666E901A5C3A5BF8300100100001BE00000A59275C3A5BF8FF0C4EE553CA727959275C3A5BF8300200100001BE00000A904E53BB90FD662F90196A235206985E7684FF0C4F462026202600100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D5230FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近發現原來那並不是\n尺寸的差異，而是種類不同。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n牠們是不同種類的寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD1767C73FE539F4F8690A34E264E0D662F000A5C3A5BF876845DEE7570FF0C800C662F7A2E985E4E0D540C300200100001BE00000A72605011662F4E0D540C7A2E985E76845BF653EF5922FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是有了新的命名方式，也就是\n小顆種、中顆種、大顆種，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以及巨顆種。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F67094E8665B07684547D540D65B95F0FFF0C4E5F5C31662F000A5C0F98467A2E30014E2D98467A2E3001592798467A2EFF0C00100001BE00000A4EE553CA5DE898467A2E300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個叫法與其說是種類名，\n反而更像是品種名呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B53EB6CD5820751768AAA662F7A2E985E540DFF0C000A53CD800C66F450CF662F54C17A2E540D54622026202600100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我很好奇牠們的種類是否真的不同，\n所以收集了各種尺寸的南瓜精。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F88597D59477260501176847A2E985E662F5426771F76844E0D540CFF0C000A62404EE5653696C64E8654047A2E5C3A5BF87684535774DC7CBE300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但還沒能發現\n屬於最大尺寸的巨顆種！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690846C9280FD767C73FE000A5C6C65BC670059275C3A5BF876845DE898467A2EFF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨顆種的南瓜精會在夜裡\n出現在15號野生特區。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE67035728591C88E1000A51FA73FE572800310035865F91CE751F72795340300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！\n把一隻巨顆種的南瓜精讓給我吧！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF01000A628A4E0096BB5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE8B937D6662115427FF01FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨顆種的南瓜精\n會比這些孩子們都還要大！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE000A67036BD490194E9B5B695B50501190FD908489815927FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，我的請求有個但書。\n我不接受頭目……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因為那樣我就無法知道牠真正的大小了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C621176848ACB6C426709500B4F4666F83002000A62114E0D63A553D7982D76EE2026202600100001BE00000A56E070BA90A36A2362115C3171216CD577E590537260771F6B63768459275C0F4E86300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要把巨顆種的南瓜精讓給我嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981628A5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE8B937D66621155CEFF1F00100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我心中的期待，\n已經膨脹到有如巨顆種！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳快點讓給我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115FC34E2D7684671F5F85FF0C000A5DF27D9381A881395230670959825DE898467A2EFF0100100001BE00000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35FEB9EDE8B937D6662115427FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓給我的是\n巨顆種的南瓜精。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n巨顆種的南瓜精會在夜裡\n出現在15號野生特區喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B38B937D6662117684662F000A5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE300200100001BE01000A5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE67035728591C88E1000A51FA73FE572800310035865F91CE751F727953405594300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這巨顆種是隻頭目！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不行哪！不不不，我是很高興，\n但尺寸這麼大的南瓜精，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我好擔心牠究竟會帶多少靈魂去另一個世界。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195DE898467A2E662F96BB982D76EEFF0100100001BE01000A4E0D884C54EAFF014E0D4E0D4E0DFF0C6211662F5F889AD88208FF0C000A4F465C3A5BF890199EBC59277684535774DC7CBEFF0C00100001BE00000A6211597D64D45FC372607A767ADF67035E36591A5C1197489B4253BB53E64E00500B4E16754C300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我心中的不安，\n已經膨脹到有如巨顆種！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n頭目我就敬謝不敏了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115FC34E2D76844E0D5B89FF0C000A5DF27D9381A881395230670959825DE898467A2EFF0100100001BE00000A982D76EE62115C31656C8B1D4E0D654F4E86300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "巨顆種的南瓜精……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE20262026FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠會用這副大身體把巨大尺寸的靈魂\n運到另一個世界，這真是太神秘了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260670375289019526F59278EAB9AD4628A5DE859275C3A5BF8768497489B42000A904B523053E64E00500B4E16754CFF0C9019771F662F592A795E79D84E86FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使長得很像，只要尺寸不同\n就是不同種類的寶可夢。我信服了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F95775F975F8850CFFF0C53EA89815C3A5BF84E0D540C000A5C31662F4E0D540C7A2E985E76845BF653EF5922300262114FE1670D4E86FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對不起。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n其實我沒有真的搞懂，\n但是我被這尺寸震撼得不得不信服。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E0D8D77300200100001BE01000A51765BE662116C926709771F7684641E61C2FF0C000A4F46662F621188AB90195C3A5BF8970764BC5F974E0D5F974E0D4FE1670D300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要配得上這個尺寸，\n今後我會把自己的靈魂好好培育茁壯的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E868981914D5F974E0A9019500B5C3A5BF8FF0C000A4ECA5F8C62116703628A81EA5DF1768497489B42597D597D57F980B2830158EF7684300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我打從心底感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳\n將巨顆種的南瓜精讓給我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621162535F9E5FC35E95611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3000A5C075DE898467A2E7684535774DC7CBE8B937D666211300200100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有4種南瓜精，\n就能把任何尺寸的靈魂都運到另一個世界。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有需要時儘管告訴我，別客氣喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981670900347A2E535774DC7CBEFF0C000A5C3180FD628A4EFB4F555C3A5BF8768497489B4290FD904B523053E64E00500B4E16754C300200100001BE00000A670997008981664251187BA1544A8A346211FF0C52255BA26C235594FF0100100002011401750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    }
